VERDICT -- k04
======================================================================================================================
  Q = gamma_perp/gamma_par = 1.1258, spanning 1.0330 - 1.2789 over ten kernels,
  two a_0 footings and two frozen g_ext values -- a 22% spread where gamma_v itself spans 55%.
  Newton and every dark-matter model give exactly 1.0000 with no free parameter.
  After projection into the observable plane with a 30/60 degree bin split, Q = 1.0540: 1.9 x the frozen sigma_tot.
  d log Q/d log Upsilon = 0 and d log Q/d log D = 0 exactly, by cancellation between the two bins.

